!Name: o0056-gun
!C p56 glider gun
!C 31 Herschels circulate in a 1736-step loop of 180-degree rotational
!C symmetry (almost). The 24 Herschel conduits used are of the following
!C four types: p8 65-step left turn/flip, p8 73-step left turn/flip,
!C p8 77-step translate/flip and p4 77-step translate/flip with glider
!C release. One half of the loop is made up of the following 12
!C Herschel conduits: 3 x 65, 77, 73, 3 x 77, and 4 x 73 steps.
!C Noam Elkies and Dieter Leithner and Dean Hickerson, 31 Jan 1998
!CSlight improvement by Stephen Silver by using Elkies' new
!Cp7 pipsquirter, 7 Aug 1999
!
